msgid "文件传输"
msgstr "File Transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:7 9debf0b15ff840d6b342092a9ed89066
msgid "用户数据存储空间"
msgstr "User Data Storage Space"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:11 62b8d3bd20ad44f8892f96b606a19b95
#, fuzzy
msgid "在cnSRC上，系统根据使用模式为用户在共享文件系统上分配三种目录，分别是个人目录，项目目录。"
msgstr ""
"On cnSRC, the system allocates three directories on the shared file "
"system according to usage modes: personal directory, project directory, "
"and public cluster directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:13 87fcca71ef5b4e53903feb54c4dcaf44
msgid "在实例或集群中，这三种目录所对应的路径不同，具体见下表："
msgstr ""
"In the instance or cluster, the paths corresponding to these three "
"directories are different, as shown in the following table:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 2ef83c98f3784a6694eeb6a9cd63e0a7
msgid "个人目录"
msgstr "Personal Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 aa10fc8444be41509ebb6bbeecff4dd0
