msgstr "/webdav/MyData"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 50fb94079baa4a5c9a8e4b77e800081b
msgid "/webdav/ProjectGroup(<project>)"
msgstr "/webdav/ProjectGroup(<project>)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 7aa801bb8cfa4ac9b58bf71e26a37ba9
msgid "/webdav/ProjectGroup(public_cluster)"
msgstr "/webdav/ProjectGroup(public_cluster)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 e90280ae11a2427bbe844a44967ebda3
msgid "公共集群"
msgstr "Public Cluster"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 e7fc413ad5664899b1261489d615f96e
msgid "/users/username"
msgstr "/users/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 00b9a2e305884eff8b84103c08b018b7
msgid "/groups/<project id>/home/username"
msgstr "/groups/<project id>/home/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 e5b1914c36464561a2c023f85b7fb498
msgid "Web文件管理"
msgstr "Web File Manager"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 eb96130269724e46957f454261f0758f
msgid "个人家目录"
msgstr "Home Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 6b1b489ba89b4e1eb2337704548ccb0e
msgid "项目组目录（选择相应项目组）"
msgstr "Project group directory (select the corresponding project group)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 372b6aa0607d473d8f8f6caeb459b56d
msgid "项目组目录（如有public_cluster选项）"
msgstr "Project group directory (if a public_cluster option is available)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:27 f5022270648348408afa437ec52bd465
msgid "username请替换为自己的用户名（这个信息可以在“我的信息”-“基本信息”中查询）。"
msgstr ""
"change username to your own username (this information can be found in "
"\"my information\"-\"basic information\")."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:29 5dbd6bd4d2b549cbb604e9c0cdc4a98f
msgid "<project id>请替换为\"g+项目ID\"（项目基本信息中查询项目ID），例：项目ID为700008，则替换为“g700008”。"
msgstr ""
"change <project id> to \"g+project id\" (project id can be found in "
"project basic information), for example: if project id is 700008, then "
"change it to \"g700008\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:31 817dfe16de784ed289d1ec938730398c
msgid "<project>请替换为项目名（项目基本信息中查询。）"
msgstr ""
"change <project> to project name (can be found in project basic "
"information)."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:35 7cea7c7befaa4b7180dc818a361778c0
msgid "Web文件管理通过“个人家目录”和“项目组目录”切换数据位置。 页面顶部显示的是当前浏览位置，不应直接作为实例或集群中的文件系统路径使用。"
msgstr ""
"Use Web File Manager to switch between \"Home Directory\" and \"Project "
"group directory\". The path shown at the top of the page is the current "
"browsing location and should not be used directly as a filesystem path "
"inside an instance or cluster."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:40 db932e93925b4003a0ac443582e4af01
msgid "Web文件管理与数据传输"
msgstr "Web File Manager and Data Transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:42 2f301397752340ef81d980865f309123
msgid ""
"登录麒麟平台后，点击左侧菜单 **文件管理**，或直接打开 `文件管理页面 "
"<https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/File/>`__， 即可浏览目录、搜索文件、新建文件夹，以及上传和下载文件。"
msgstr ""
"After logging in to the Kylin platform, click **File Manager** in the "
"left menu, or open the `File Manager page "
"<https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/File/>`__, to browse directories, search "
"files, create folders, and upload or download files."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:47 e48804148f904f299b9172e4f6509a6b
msgid "选择数据目录"
msgstr "Select a Data Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:49 3eafe3a19f164d708fcf2c83ad2a47b8
msgid "**个人家目录**：点击此按钮返回个人存储空间，页面顶部显示 ``~/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Home Directory**: click this button to return to your personal storage."
" The page header shows ``~/``."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:50 b888d4eb98c54fc3ac9fa8a2698f3e60
msgid ""
"**项目组目录**：展开下拉列表，选择需要访问的项目组。页面顶部显示对应的项目组目录， 例如 ``test_project/``；进入其 "
"``data`` 子目录后显示 ``test_project/data/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Project group directory**: expand the dropdown and select the project "
"group to access. The page header shows the corresponding project path, "
"for example ``test_project/``; after entering its ``data`` subdirectory "
"it shows ``test_project/data/``."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:53 5818f1d115fd4c1691adc18387958585
msgid "操作前先核对页面顶部的路径，确保上传文件或新建文件夹的位置正确。 项目组目录的可选项以当前账号页面中显示的列表为准。"
msgstr ""
"Before any operation, check the path at the top of the page so uploads "
"and new folders go to the right place. Available project group "
"directories follow the list shown for the current account."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:56 00ca7064305a46e98907a85ddb0b8d75
msgid "文件列表包含 **文件名**、**文件大小**、**上次修改时间** 和 **操作** 四列， 可通过名称旁的文件夹图标或文件图标区分目录和文件。"
msgstr ""
"The file list has four columns: **Name**, **Size**, **Last modified**, "
"and **Actions**. Use the folder or file icon next to the name to tell "
"directories from files."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:59 8e703a37272c4ffd9e739d76a87b059e
msgid "文件管理中的目录切换、工具栏及文件列表"
msgstr "Directory switcher, toolbar, and file list in File Manager"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:63 0403dc522b3a4cb8a0a77be5d886da1f
msgid "项目组目录示例：顶部显示当前路径，下方为目录切换入口、工具栏和文件列表。"
msgstr ""
"Project group directory example: the current path is shown at the top, "
"with the directory switcher, toolbar, and file list below."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:66 caf84213a9ad46d9abfed961cbbcd581
msgid "浏览和搜索文件"
msgstr "Browse and Search Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:68 b789d42c13a14358a259430c330977c1
msgid "点击文件夹名称，进入该子目录；点击 **返回上一级** 返回父目录。"
msgstr ""
"Click a folder name to enter that subdirectory; click **Up one level** to"
" return to the parent directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:69 a43503400c5142a4b1001ba7b4383351
msgid "在 **搜索文件** 输入框中输入文件名关键字，点击右侧放大镜按钮，筛选当前目录中的条目。"
msgstr ""
"In the **Search files** box, enter a filename keyword and click the "
"magnifier on the right to filter entries in the current directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:70 518a4f41bc6340cf89c3e39e319771f2
msgid "清空搜索框并再次点击放大镜按钮，可恢复当前目录的完整列表。"
msgstr ""
"Clear the search box and click the magnifier again to restore the full "
"list for the current directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:71 a0854d674f36476ca9a8e365d62ff0bc
msgid "文件较多时，使用列表底部的页码或左右箭头切换分页。"
msgstr ""
"When there are many files, use the page numbers or left/right arrows at "
"the bottom of the list to change pages."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:74 13347cf857654eb990828f34195e4cbc
msgid "新建文件夹"
msgstr "Create Folder"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:76 00d0f2951d4543b2b02e4d8c888e36a0
msgid "进入目标目录，点击工具栏中的 **新建文件夹**。"
msgstr "Enter the target directory and click **New folder** on the toolbar."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:77 7ddd3a1a1358446c8140d02477a203cf
msgid "在弹出的对话框中输入文件夹名称，点击 **OK**。"
msgstr "In the dialog, enter the folder name and click **OK**."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:78 d30ebfd0d51e491a9f6160ca4442927d
msgid "检查当前列表中是否出现新文件夹；如需放弃创建，点击 **Cancel** 或右上角关闭按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the new folder appears in the current list; to cancel, click "
"**Cancel** or the close button at the top right."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:81 0863ec98197e47938b21b71bcd657bff
msgid "上传文件"
msgstr "Upload Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:83 6838e58341b4492f9a72c18aa3e779d6
msgid "进入需要保存文件的个人目录或项目组目录，点击工具栏中的 **上传文件**。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the home or project group directory where files should be saved, "
"then click **Upload** on the toolbar."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:84 13b7ce80864d4c56a3bd7d4881464892
msgid "在弹出的对话框中，再次点击 **上传文件**，通过本地文件选择窗口选择文件。"
msgstr ""
"In the dialog, click **Upload** again and choose a file in the local file"
" picker."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:85 20c92010bf204a4e8aada8940544b01f
msgid "查看上传窗口中的状态及提示，按界面提示完成操作并关闭窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Watch the status and messages in the upload window, follow the on-screen "
"prompts, then close the window."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:86 3d4bc61b902844b99b13ffeb1d876f25
msgid "回到文件列表，核对文件名和文件大小，确认文件已出现在预期目录。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the file list and verify the filename and size to confirm the "
"file is in the expected directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:88 a2e5604509204fb1932843e674edb74d
msgid "Web文件上传对话框，包含上传文件、Cancel和OK按钮"
msgstr "Web file upload dialog with Upload, Cancel, and OK buttons"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:92 50c1a474d01f4d9990507f1c80db862b
msgid "上传文件对话框；其中的“上传文件”按钮用于选择本地文件。"
msgstr "Upload dialog; the \"Upload\" button is used to select a local file."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:96 257a470414db4d5a985e1269286e50e0
msgid "当前上传窗口的文件选择控件每次只允许选择一个本地文件，多个文件需逐个操作。 文件大小或数量限制、失败原因以实际上传时的平台提示为准。"
msgstr ""
"The file picker in the current upload window allows only one local file "
"at a time; upload multiple files one by one. Size/count limits and "
"failure reasons follow the platform messages shown during upload."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:100 87b8f8df2ea24b81af6ed00c353dd950
msgid "下载文件"
msgstr "Download Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:102 5e0a547403824f77a43a47318c55b936
msgid "进入文件所在目录，点击文件名称下载，并在浏览器中查看下载进度和保存位置。 文件夹名称用于进入目录；如需传输整个目录，可使用下文介绍的SSH传输方式。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the directory that contains the file, click the filename to "
"download, and check progress and save location in the browser. Folder "
"names open directories; to transfer a whole directory, use the SSH "
"methods described below."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:106 413875fa0fa649cf9ca65b3d1ff35966
msgid "删除与操作注意事项"
msgstr "Deletion and Operation Notes"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:108 33047173337f45c0a6cd801ab316b6be
msgid ""
"文件列表 **操作** 列中的红色 **×** 为删除入口。 删除前应核对当前目录和目标名称，并提前备份重要数据； "
"项目组目录中的操作还需确认不会影响其他成员使用的数据。"
msgstr ""
"The red **x** in the **Actions** column deletes an item. Before deleting,"
" verify the current directory and target name, and back up important "
"data; in a project group directory, also confirm you will not affect data"
" used by other members."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:114 47aa05c3888247aeac57438dff978602
msgid ""
"不要随意删除或覆盖个人目录中的配置文件（例如 ``.bashrc``、``.ssh`` 中的文件）。 "
"上传失败或文件未出现在列表中时，先检查当前路径、搜索条件、网络连接和页面错误提示， 确认原因后再重试，避免重复传输或误操作。"
msgstr ""
"Do not casually delete or overwrite configuration files in your home "
"directory (for example files under ``.bashrc`` or ``.ssh``). If an upload"
" fails or a file does not appear in the list, first check the current "
"path, search filter, network connection, and page error messages, then "
"retry after you understand the cause to avoid duplicate transfers or "
"mistakes."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:119 1707292ac49a49298a61243d7119a1d9
msgid "通过ssh账户传输"
msgstr "transfer through ssh account"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:123 aaf62866a3fb4a4fac3bde485c5dbdde
msgid "由于Web传输文件功能有限，对于开放了SSH端口的集群或实例，用户可以通过SSH账户使用scp类的工具来传输数据。"
msgstr ""
"Because the web file transfer function is limited, for the cluster or "
"instance with open SSH port, users can use scp tools to transfer data "
"through SSH account."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:125 def90ebc792343818b725cb5210337e1
msgid ""
"以公共集群项目为例，用户在 **项目** -> *public cluster* 的页面里，选择 **实例** "
"，点击实例最右侧的SSH服务地址按钮，会弹出cnSRC对外开放的IP地址和端口："
msgstr ""
"Using the public cluster project as an example, on the **Project** -> "
"*public cluster* page, select **Instance**, click the SSH service address"
" button at the far right of the instance, and cnSRC will display the "
"externally accessible IP address and port:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:127 3195fa7d124b4de4bfcae18c48f886e9
msgid "|ssh ip|"
msgstr "|ssh ip|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:129 86f4d5eec7314bb9ad6b5c5520305683
msgid "ssh ip"
msgstr "ssh ip"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:132 c3fead26c5c64505885f1043b9653872
msgid "首次使用SSH登录的用户需要 :ref:`重置cnSRC密码 <reset password>`"
msgstr ""
"Users logging in via SSH for the first time need to :ref:`reset their "
"cnSRC password <reset password>`"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:134 fcdf1b5642a74ce997f67d7699804e2d
msgid "|reset_pw|"
msgstr "|reset_pw|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:173 04f30847c0064547b55d005bc4eb5804
msgid "reset_pw"
msgstr "reset_pw"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:136 7aacbb954199466e97d36a3622d2a084
msgid ""
"用户在能够直接访问cnSRC服务IP地址的情况下，可以使用scp、\\ `WinSCP "
"<https://winscp.net/eng/docs/lang:chs>`__\\ 或\\ `Xmanager "
"<https://www.netsarang.com/en/xmanager/>`__\\ 等scp工具来传输数据："
msgstr ""
"When users can directly access the cnSRC service IP address, they can use"
" scp, \\ `WinSCP <https://winscp.net/eng/docs/lang:chs>`__\\ or \\ "
"`Xmanager <https://www.netsarang.com/en/xmanager/>`__\\ and other scp "
"tools to transfer data:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:143 10ae8e3f3eaa4904bd82128503ae7217
msgid "使用XFTP传输"
msgstr "Transfer with XFTP"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:145 a1a8433334594217a03699ee8f3caabc
msgid "Windows用户也可以使用\\ `XFTP <https://www.xshellcn.com/xftp.html>`__\\ 客户端进行传输。"
msgstr ""
"Windows users can also use \\ `XFTP "
"<https://www.xshellcn.com/xftp.html>`__\\ client for transmission."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:147 7fc99fd662ad4b34a4d95c30840b8db0
msgid "下载并安装XFTP软件后打开，点击“文件”-“新建”。"
msgstr "Download and install XFTP software, open it, click \"file\"-\"new\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:149 491ed7073987404496461ba10aeae1a3
msgid "|new xftp connection|"
msgstr "|new xftp connection|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:151 89d7d62e6dc04a479a2dcf3522ce971f
msgid "new xftp connection"
msgstr "new xftp connection"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:153 3a727c246df94bfdbb64d6b395148b2f
msgid "名称用户可以自定义，主机选项中输入“服务ssh“显示的服务外部地址，端口号填写“服务ssh”中的端口号，协议使用默认的SFTP，用户名和密码填写cnSRC的用户名和密码。点击”连接“。"
msgstr ""
"You can customize the name. In the host field, enter the external service"
" address shown under \"Service SSH\"; enter the port number from "
"\"Service SSH\"; use the default SFTP protocol; enter your cnSRC username"
" and password. Click \"Connect\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:155 ae0fe6ed628a40618c797695301a1382
msgid "|set xftp connection|"
msgstr "|set xftp connection|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:157 4c6a6aefea464bc2849c18f97bf071db
msgid "set xftp connection"
msgstr "set xftp connection"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:159 24ac837b786a4c73af59b1b2c7f08cfe
msgid ""
"连接后左侧为当前用户计算机的视图，右侧为远程计算机的视图，用户访问的远程计算机路径为\\ ``/home/username``\\ "
"，即当前用户的家目录，用户可将文件从个人电脑上传输到共享文件夹内，下方传输栏会显示传输任务详细信息。"
msgstr ""
"After connection, the left side is the view of the current user's "
"computer, and the right side is the view of the remote computer. The "
"remote computer path accessed by the user is \\ ``/home/username``\\ , "
"which is the home directory of the current user. The user can upload "
"files from the personal computer to the shared folder, and the "
"transmission bar below will display the detailed information of the "
"transmission task."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:161 b84623a48cd94317a77e2a05e3c3dd03
msgid "|xftp windows|"
msgstr "|xftp windows|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:163 3466af2fe4f24ad699bd5d6c252daebd
msgid "xftp windows"
msgstr "xftp windows"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:165 2b877d6c6c8d491f9cb4fea0ff94b382
msgid "传输完成后即可在公共集群或实例控制台的用户家目录中看到刚才传输的文件。"
msgstr ""
"After the transmission is completed, you can see the transferred file in "
"the user's home directory of the public cluster or instance console."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:167 7a0ef12691d44738affb3284760be6e1
msgid "|file in terminal|"
msgstr "|file in terminal|"

